WEBVTT

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:03.860
I think I need to leave the company.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.000
What's making you say that?

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:13.300
You said the work still matters.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:15.620
It does.

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:19.340
I just can't keep doing everything alone.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:25.740
Actually, I don't want to leave. I want things to change.

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:28.560
That's a different conversation.

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:33.660
What would you want your partner to understand?

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:36.240
That I need us to share the weight.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:41.640
I'll ask her to meet.

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:45.260
No pitch, just an honest conversation.

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:48.220
That sounds like a place to start.

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:55.960
Room to change your mind, space to find your next step,

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:59.640
COMPASS, a voice AI thinking partner.
